  "prompt": "A charming miniature golden royal crown: a shallow open square gold band with four short raised corner points and a central red jewel painted on its front face. Warm muted gold pixel shading. Readable royal silhouette. Keep the interior hollow above the base; no pedestal or head inside. This is an equippable hat for tiny real-animal pets in vanilla Minecraft. Create the original hat ONLY, without a pet, stand, background or text. Fit all geometry within x=2..14, z=2..14, y=0..14, centred horizontally at x=z=8, flat wearable underside exactly y=0, facing negative Z. Use 4-16 purposeful unrotated axis-aligned cuboids, not voxels or smooth curves. Single compact shared painted cube-net atlas, one texel per model unit; explicit integer uvSize for any fractional geometry. No bones or animation. Connected robust forms, no z-fighting. Distinct Minecraft-style inventory silhouette. This will be uniformly scaled to each animal head with the bottom resting on its forehead; do not model straps, hair, ears or a head.",
  "style": "Vanilla",
